<title>USA: CarrAmerica Realty Corp completes offering.</title>
<headline>CarrAmerica Realty Corp completes offering.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>CarrAmerica Realty Corp said on Tuesday it has completed an offering of 3 million common-stock shares, expected to raise $82.1 million for paying off debt and buying suburban office properties.</p>
<p>The underwriters were led by Goldman Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
